  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The Centurion swings its mallet arm.
  - The Centurion releases large gusts of heated steam.
  - The Centurion releases steam and swings its mallet at the same time.
  - The Centurion stabs with its spear arm.
  - The Centurion uses its height to stab with its spear arm from above.
  - The Centurion releases small gusts of heated steam from above.
  - The Centurion releases denser gusts of heated steam.
