  randomFlavorTexts:
  - The Centurion rains down steam. Again.
  - The Centurion swings his mallet and releases large gusts of steam. Again.
  - The Centurion stabs with its spear arm. Not from above. Again...
  - The Centurion swings his mallet arm again. No steam this time!
  - The Centurion releases dense gusts of steam. Again.
  - The Centurion stabs with its spear arm. From above. Again...
